  <section class="section" style="padding-top:40px;" aria-label="Featured programs">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <article class="feature-row reverse reveal" id="k-clubs-program">
        <div class="feature-row__media">
          <div class="feature-media">
            <img src="{{ cms.whatWeDo.featureImages.youthProgram }}" alt="Students participating in a Kiwanis-sponsored youth leadership club" loading="lazy">
            <span class="corner-tag">6 school clubs</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-row__body">
          <span class="feature-index">YOUTH LEADERSHIP</span>
          <h3>K Clubs &amp; Sponsored Youth Clubs</h3>
          <p>Kiwanis sponsors youth leadership and service clubs across Winchester-area schools. Our Key Clubs at Handley, James Wood, and Millbrook High Schools give teens the chance to lead real service projects, while our Builder's Clubs at Frederick County, James Wood, and Daniel Morgan Middle Schools introduce younger students to peer-led community service. We also support a Circle K chapter at the college level.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:24px;">
            <a href="/youth-programs/" class="btn btn-outline-blue btn-sm">Explore Youth Programs
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-dark" aria-labelledby="pancake-spotlight" id="pancake-program">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-center">
        <div class="reveal" style="border-radius:22px; overflow:hidden; aspect-ratio:16/11; box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);">
          <img src="{{ cms.whatWeDo.featureImages.pancake }}" alt="Kiwanis Pancake Day" class="img-cover">
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-d1">
          <span class="eyebrow-rule on-dark" style="margin-bottom:18px;">Our Signature Event</span>
          <h2 id="pancake-spotlight" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem); margin-bottom:18px;">Community Pancake Day</h2>
          <p class="section-body" style="margin-bottom:30px;">Pancake Day is our signature annual fundraiser and one of Winchester's most beloved traditions. Every spring the club cooks and serves a literal ton of sausage and thousands of pancakes — proceeds fund local grants, scholarships, youth programs, and organizations serving children and families.</p>
          <div class="impact-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:24px; margin-bottom:32px;">
            <div class="impact-item"><div class="impact-num">1 ton</div><div class="impact-label">Sausage cooked &amp; served</div></div>
            <div class="impact-item"><div class="impact-num">1,000s</div><div class="impact-label">Pancakes flipped each year</div></div>
          </div>
          <a href="/pancake-day/" class="btn btn-gold">View Pancake Day Details
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-tint" aria-labelledby="seasonal-heading">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <div class="section-header reveal" style="margin-bottom:40px;">
        <span class="eyebrow-rule" style="margin-bottom:14px;">Seasonal Traditions</span>
        <h2 id="seasonal-heading" class="section-title" style="margin-top:0;">When the Holidays Come to Town</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <article class="accent-card navy reveal" id="christmas-party">
          <div class="accent-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 12 20 22 4 22 4 12"/><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="5"/><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="7"/><path d="M12 7H7.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5C11 2 12 7 12 7z"/><path d="M12 7h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5C13 2 12 7 12 7z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Kids Christmas Party</h3>
          <p>Each year before Christmas, children get to shop for gifts for their family members. Club members wrap those gifts, and the children enjoy a full celebration with lunch, singing, decorations, and the joy of giving.</p>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:18px;">
            <span class="tag tag-white">Annual — December</span>
            <span class="tag tag-gold">Community Favorite</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="accent-card reveal reveal-d1" id="bell-ringing">
          <div class="accent-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.73 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.46 0"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Salvation Army Bell Ringing</h3>
          <p>Every holiday season, members brave the cold to staff Salvation Army donation kettles around Winchester. Our consistent coverage helps the Salvation Army raise funds for food, shelter, and emergency assistance programs that serve thousands of families.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:18px;"><span class="tag tag-blue">Seasonal — Holiday</span></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="yearround-heading">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <div class="section-header reveal" style="margin-bottom:40px;">
        <span class="eyebrow-rule" style="margin-bottom:14px;">Year-Round Service</span>
        <h2 id="yearround-heading" class="section-title" style="margin-top:0;">Showing Up All Year Long</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <article class="accent-card reveal" id="blood-drives">
          <div class="accent-icon" style="background:rgba(220,38,38,0.1); color:#DC2626;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.69l5.66 5.66a8 8 0 1 1-11.31 0z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Red Cross Blood Drives</h3>
          <p>Several times a year, members team up with the American Red Cross to organize and staff blood drives. Each donation can save up to three lives.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="tag tag-blue">Multiple / Year</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="accent-card reveal reveal-d1" id="highway-cleanup">
          <div class="accent-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3l7.07 16.97 2.51-7.39 7.39-2.51L3 3z"/><path d="M13 13l6 6"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Highway Cleanup</h3>
          <p>Twice a year, members suit up in safety gear to clear a designated two-mile stretch of road near Winchester — keeping our roadways clean and beautiful.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="tag tag-blue">Twice / Year</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="accent-card reveal reveal-d2" id="scholarships">
          <div class="accent-icon" style="background:rgba(255,209,0,0.18); color:var(--kw-gold-dark);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Scholarships</h3>
          <p>Kiwanis awards scholarships to outstanding Key Club members who've shown a real commitment to service and leadership — investing in our most dedicated young volunteers.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="tag tag-gold">Annual Award</span></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-tint" aria-labelledby="speakers-heading" id="guest-speakers">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <div class="section-header text-center reveal" style="max-width:640px; margin:0 auto 56px;">
        <span class="eyebrow-rule center" style="margin-bottom:16px;">Wednesday Meetings</span>
        <h2 id="speakers-heading" class="section-title" style="margin-top:0;">Guest Speakers &amp; Programs</h2>
        <p class="section-body" style="margin:0 auto;">Each week at our Wednesday noon meeting, we hear from community leaders, local organizations, and subject-matter experts on topics ranging from local government to health, business, and service opportunities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start reveal">
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:700; color:var(--kw-blue); margin-bottom:20px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;"><span style="width:8px; height:8px; background:var(--kw-gold); border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0; display:inline-block;"></span>Upcoming Speakers</h3>
          <div style="background:white; border-radius:14px; padding:20px 22px; border:1px solid var(--kw-border); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px;">
            <div style="width:44px; height:44px; background:var(--kw-blue-light); border-radius:10px; flex-shrink:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:var(--kw-blue);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div>
            <div><p style="font-weight:600; color:var(--kw-navy); margin-bottom:2px; font-size:0.95rem;">Speaker announcements coming soon</p><p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--kw-muted);">Check back or join us Wednesday at noon</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:700; color:var(--kw-navy); margin-bottom:20px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;"><span style="width:8px; height:8px; background:var(--kw-blue); border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0; display:inline-block;"></span>Recent &amp; Past Guests</h3>
          <div style="background:white; border-radius:14px; padding:18px 22px; border:1px solid var(--kw-border);">
            <p style="font-size:0.875rem; color:var(--kw-muted); font-style:italic;">Past speaker information will be listed here as the club shares details. If you've presented at a Winchester Kiwanis meeting and would like to be listed, <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--kw-blue); font-weight:600;">contact us.</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center reveal" style="margin-top:48px;">
        <p style="color:var(--kw-muted); margin-bottom:18px; font-size:1rem;">Want to speak at a Wednesday meeting? We welcome representatives from local nonprofits, schools, government, and community organizations.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-outline-blue">Inquire About Speaking</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;" aria-label="Community support call to action">
    <div class="kw-container">
      <div class="cta-band reveal">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center" style="position:relative; z-index:2;">
          <div>
            <span class="tag tag-gold" style="margin-bottom:18px; display:inline-flex;">Community Requests</span>
            <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.2vw,2.5rem); margin-bottom:14px;">Need Support for a Local Project?</h2>
            <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.78); max-width:520px; line-height:1.7; font-size:1.05rem;">Winchester Kiwanis supports projects that serve children, youth leadership, families, and the local community. Send a concise request with the need, amount, timeline, and community impact.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; justify-content:flex-start;" class="lg:justify-end">
            <a href="/resources/#grant-requests" class="btn btn-gold">Request Support</a>
            <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-outline-white">Contact the Club</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
